texts.en:
10. A report submitted by e-mail must contain at least the following data:
1) the personal and contact data of the person who drew up the report and of the reporting person;
2) the type and number of the report;
3) the main ground for submitting the report and, where there are any, additional ground(s);
4) the identification data, roles in the transaction and location data of all participants in the transaction;
5) data on the subject of the transaction;
